    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Update 0.3 is finally live!</strong> Level cap increased to 22. New zones, new dungeon, lots of new stuff.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Old-school 2D fantasy open world MMORPG</strong></i> - all the basic stuff you'd expect, like classes, monsters, loot, dungeons, quests, leveling, player trading, auction houses, talent trees, achievements, professions, and so on.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>No pay-to-win (ever!)</strong></i> - the price of the game is what you see on the tin. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Mix of handcrafted and generated worlds and dungeons</strong></i> - every day Junjun the Portal Master will open up a gateway to another world that has never been visited before.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Gods and deities</strong></i> - discover new deities, show your allegiance to them and they'll reward you.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Update 0.3 is finally live!</strong> Level cap increased to 22. New zones, new dungeon, lots of new stuff.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Old-school 2D fantasy open world MMORPG</strong></i> - all the basic stuff you'd expect, like classes, monsters, loot, dungeons, quests, leveling, player trading, auction houses, talent trees, achievements, professions, and so on.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>No pay-to-win (ever!)</strong></i> - the price of the game is what you see on the tin. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Mix of handcrafted and generated worlds and dungeons</strong></i> - every day Junjun the Portal Master will open up a gateway to another world that has never been visited before.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Gods and deities</strong></i> - discover new deities, show your allegiance to them and they'll reward you.</p></li></ul>",
